      },
      "text": "Section 1. E stablish m en t o f  B oard. There is established, effective immediately, \na board of three members to be appointed by the President to investigate this \ndispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any \norganization of railroad employees or any carrier."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2207,
      "char_start": 1889,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12414#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 17,
      "scope_id": "EO:12414#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "48 FR 14861, PDF pages 17-18",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "9152dc1e8c7358608d93fc9ccd1f742fd5931c47bd6a8d7c183d423e4738ab87",
        "signing_date": "1983-04-04",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12414.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a60439d07431618135b8d89f85149c0b1fabee5506be81d79cbc4b76de5408a0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-04-06/pdf/FR-1983-04-06.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. R eport. Within 30 days after creation of the board the parties to the \ndispute shall submit to the board final offers for settlement of the dispute. \nWithin 30 days after the submission of final offers the board shall submit a \nreport to the President setting forth its selection of the most reasonable offer."
    },
    {
