        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "9152dc1e8c7358608d93fc9ccd1f742fd5931c47bd6a8d7c183d423e4738ab87",
        "signing_date": "1983-04-04",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12414.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a60439d07431618135b8d89f85149c0b1fabee5506be81d79cbc4b76de5408a0",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-04-06/pdf/FR-1983-04-06.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. M aintaining C onditions. As provided by Section 9A(h) of the Act, as \namended, from the time a request to establish a board is made until 60 days \nafter the board makes its report, no change, except by agreement, shall be \nmade by the parties in the conditions out of which the dispute arose."
